6,                      $ Link Path Size
"20 0F 24 03 30 01",    $ Link Path to DOG object's fault value attribute.
0x0002,                 $ No support for settable path, scaling, scaling links, or
			$ real time update of value.  Value is gettable and 
			$ Settable.  Enumerated strings are supported.
24,                     $ Data Type - string
1,                      $ Data Size - (in bytes)
"Output Fault Value, 0-7",   $ Parameter Name
"",                     $ Units String
	$$$$$$$$$$ Help string $$$$$$$$$$$
"IF the boxes in Parameter 2 are NOT checked, checking these boxes causes the\noutputs to turn ON during a communications fault. Leaving them blank causes the\noutputs to turn OFF during a communications fault.",
